 "metadata": {
  "note": "Verbatim DDInter 2.0 slice for issue #338 — the recorded-allergy cross-reactivity sentence its captured answer opens on. Two rows, field-for-field their KB rows and in KB order: DDInter513 Dexamethasone (DB01234) then DDInter885 Hydrocortisone (DB00741), which share the level-4 ATC subgroup H02AB and so relate through DrugSafetyValidator.sharedClass rather than through any curated group. Every KB interaction row falling wholly inside the slice is included — one, rated Unknown against mechanism group -1, whose text the KB states as null — and the mechanisms map carries that group's own entry. Nothing here is hand-authored. Sliced 2026-09-04 from the bundled openmrs-ddi-knowledge-base by name equality over its 2283 drug rows. A slice rather than DrugReferenceTestSupport.shippedEntries() because the cases that read it assert record TEXT, which that accessor's javadoc reserves for one; that it is still a slice is what SlicedReferenceRowProvenanceTest holds."
 },
